# MIG Master

> Hardware accessories for lawful personal cartridge collection workflows

MIG Master is an online retailer focused on cartridge-related hardware accessories, reader accessories, controllers, and portable gaming accessories. Product pages describe package contents, compatibility notes, shipping, returns, and responsible-use boundaries. No games, software licenses, or protected materials are included with MIG Flash products.

## Collections

- [Featured products](https://migmaster.shop/collections/frontpage): Featured products is a collection page on the MIG Master store that groups a selection of products for easy browsing.

## Products

- [Mig Flash Dumper — USB-C Cartridge Reader Accessory](https://migmaster.shop/products/mig-flash-dumper): Mig Flash Dumper is a USB-C cartridge reader accessory for customers who maintain legally owned physical cartridges and want a desktop-friendly way to manage their personal collection workflow. It is the companion reader for Mig Flash V2, but it is sold separately and is not required for every setup.
- [Mig Flash V2 — Cartridge Management Accessory](https://migmaster.shop/products/mig-flash-v2): Mig Flash V2 is a compact cartridge management accessory for customers who maintain a legally owned physical cartridge collection and want a cleaner way to organize their personal setup. The V2 model adds a top-mounted toggle button for easier item selection during normal use. It is sold as hardware only and does not include games, software licenses, a microSD card, or protected materials.
- [AOLION K20 Hall Effect Gaming Controller — Zero Drift, Mechanical Buttons, Custom Macros](https://migmaster.shop/products/game-controller): AOLION K20 Hall Effect Gaming Controller — Zero Drift, Mechanical Buttons, Custom Macros.
- [GameSir G7 Pro Tri-Mode Xbox, PC & Android Controller](https://migmaster.shop/products/gamesir-g7-pro-tri-mode-xbox-pc-android-controller): GameSir G7 Pro Tri-Mode Xbox, PC & Android Controller.
- [GameSir G7 Pro 8K PC Champion Edition Controller](https://migmaster.shop/products/gamesir-g7-pro-8k-pc-champion-edition-controller): GameSir G7 Pro 8K PC Champion Edition Controller.

